    justification: "requires understanding D import system (modules, package imports, selective imports) and modifying the D analyzer's call resolution. Lower priority than other linker work (affects a smaller user base)."  # 1546
    description: "DMD bakeoff shows 72.2% orphan rate and 5.3% cross-file ratio despite extracting 78K nodes. D symbols are extracted but import-based cross-file calls are not resolved. Would benefit the D ecosystem (DMD, Phobos, etc.). Deferred: requires understanding D import system (modules, package imports, selective imports) and modifying the D analyzer's call resolution. Lower priority than other linker work (affects a smaller user base)."  # 1546
